# Six Dutch cities. Distances are driving km (rounded).
# Same shape as Dijkstra's actual 1959 demo: Rotterdam to Groningen,
# just shrunk from 64 cities down to six.

Rotterdam Utrecht 60
Rotterdam Amsterdam 85
Utrecht Amsterdam 40
Utrecht Amersfoort 25
Amsterdam Amersfoort 45
Amersfoort Zwolle 50
Amsterdam Zwolle 110
Zwolle Groningen 100

START Rotterdam
END Groningen
